  "title": "Evaluate a persisted prepared expression",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Evaluate a persisted prepared expression",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "The real authoring producer stores the versioned FROG AST of x^2+c. Binding [c,x] to [4,5] yields 29. This portable Record is not an NI binary instruction table.\n\nThe real authoring producer stores the versioned FROG AST of x^2+c. Binding [c,x] to [4,5] yields 29. This portable Record is not an NI binary instruction table.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.formula.evaluation@1; compiled owned-value service.\nExpected:\noutput-result (f64) = 29\noutput-error (cluster<\"status\":bool,\"code\":i32,\"source\":string>) = {\"status\":false,\"code\":0,\"source\":\"\"}\n",
